<section style="padding:96px 24px 40px;"><div style="max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;"><div class="rich"><p>If you heat with oil in Bay Roberts, the tag on your tank matters more than most people think, right up until the delivery driver reads the date and won't fill it. Bay Roberts and the towns around it, Spaniard's Bay, Harbour Grace and Carbonear, have a lot of older houses still on oil, and a lot of steel tanks that were tagged years ago and haven't been looked at since. Harbour Tank Co <a href="/oil-tank-replacement-st-johns/">replaces</a> and <a href="/oil-tank-removal-st-johns/">removes</a> those tanks, and the price goes in writing before anyone leaves St. John's.</p><p>Conception Bay North has fewer tank contractors than the city, so most homeowners here are already used to booking someone from out of town. Bay Roberts is about an hour from St. John's, and we group our CBN jobs together so the drive isn't a reason to put you off. If the tag has already run out or there's oil on the basement floor, the 24/7 emergency line at <strong>(709) 800-3117</strong> is there for exactly that.</p></div></div></section>
<section style="padding:0 24px 64px;"><div style="max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;">
    <span class="kicker">What We Do in Bay Roberts</span>
    <h2 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,32px);margin:0 0 28px;">Services for Bay Roberts Properties</h2>
    <div class="feat-grid" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:20px;">
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #D9E6E6;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(13,44,71,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#0E4F5C;margin:0 0 8px;">Oil Tank Replacement in Bay Roberts</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">A new steel or fibreglass tank installed and tagged by a licensed installer, with the old one hauled away, so your supplier can put your Bay Roberts address back on the delivery list. We handle the disconnect, the lines, the base and the paperwork.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #D9E6E6;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(13,44,71,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#0E4F5C;margin:0 0 8px;">Oil Tank Removal</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">We drain, disconnect and remove old tanks from Bay Roberts basements, porches and outside pads, and deal with the leftover oil and sludge properly. It's the right move if you've gone to a heat pump or you're selling a house with a tank that's past its date.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #D9E6E6;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(13,44,71,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#0E4F5C;margin:0 0 8px;">Fibreglass Tank Upgrade</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Salt air off Conception Bay is hard on steel, and fibreglass won't rust through from either side. It also carries a much longer tag, which means fewer replacements over the life of the house and fewer December surprises.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #D9E6E6;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(13,44,71,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#0E4F5C;margin:0 0 8px;">Expired Tag and Leak Emergencies</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Refused delivery because the tag ran out, or an oil smell in the basement you can't place? Call the 24/7 line and we'll tell you straight when we can be in Bay Roberts, not a vague 'sometime next week'.</p>
      </div>
</div>
